 "title": "Mismatch reflects power",
 "caption": "On a 50 Ω line the reflection |Γ| = |Z_L − 50|/(Z_L + 50) is zero only for a matched load. A 75 Ω load gives Γ = 25/125 = 0.2, VSWR = (1 + 0.2)/(1 − 0.2) = 1.5, and 4% of the power is reflected. Open and short circuits reflect everything.",
